      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.37,
      "end_seconds": 3.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.81,
      "end_seconds": 4.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Hi there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.18,
      "end_seconds": 8.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Have you been here before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.11,
      "end_seconds": 13.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "A couple of times, but not recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.81,
      "end_seconds": 17.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.02,
      "end_seconds": 29.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "I've been losing things, and I wanted to get it checked. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.52,
      "end_seconds": 37.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.09,
      "end_seconds": 41.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "For six months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.29,
      "end_seconds": 45.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Did you notice any head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.53,
      "end_seconds": 48.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Definitely no head injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.48,
      "end_seconds": 54.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Did you get drug use, low mood or thoughts of self-harm?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.9,
      "end_seconds": 63.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "No, no drug use, low mood or thoughts of self-harm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.2,
      "end_seconds": 67.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.29,
      "end_seconds": 71.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Hmm, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.97,
      "end_seconds": 75.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.83,
      "end_seconds": 81.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.21,
      "end_seconds": 85.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.56,
      "end_seconds": 90.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.79,
      "end_seconds": 93.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.84,
      "end_seconds": 104.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I swim twice a week. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.87,
      "end_seconds": 115.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.93,
      "end_seconds": 119.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.38,
      "end_seconds": 125.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.31,
      "end_seconds": 129.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.73,
      "end_seconds": 132.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.28,
      "end_seconds": 148.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.3,
      "end_seconds": 153.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Atorvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.24,
      "end_seconds": 157.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.86,
      "end_seconds": 169.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.28,
      "end_seconds": 193.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "okay: BP is 123 over 80, pulse 80, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.61,
      "end_seconds": 196.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.69,
      "end_seconds": 199.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "we'll go over that shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.55,
      "end_seconds": 207.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.05,
      "end_seconds": 212.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I'll listen to to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.34,
      "end_seconds": 231.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Your pulse and blood pressure are normal and your examination is unremarkable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.3,
      "end_seconds": 236.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.36,
      "end_seconds": 263.45,
      "duration_seconds": 14.09,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? It points towards possible adult attention deficit disorder. So, to recap quickly. You've been losing things for six months, and no drug use or thoughts of self-harm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.64,
      "end_seconds": 266.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "that's it, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.18,
      "end_seconds": 296.67,
      "duration_seconds": 29.49,
      "text": "A thyroid test is what I'd like next, for poor concentration. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Use lists and and reminders while we arrange the specialist assessment. Let's get you seen by the adult ADHD service, I'll arrange the letter. A questionnaire is something we might do if this doesn't improve in two weeks. I'd like you back after the assessment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.86,
      "end_seconds": 302.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "right, that's the plan. Do you wanna ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.15,
      "end_seconds": 304.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}